WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Two repairs can have very similar titles.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.460
In All Tickets, search for the ticket number rather than guessing which repair is yours.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.970
Open the matching row and select Details.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:14.400
Compare the original description with the category and studio before you take action.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.480
Look under Status and Assignment to find the current owner.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.390
The person who reported the problem is not necessarily the person fixing it.
